sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Guest User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as Backend API (Express)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    G->>FE: Add products as guest
    FE->>API: POST /api/cart (guestId)
    API->>DB: Save guest cart
    DB-->>API: Guest cart
    API-->>FE: Guest cart state

    G->>FE: Log in
    FE->>API: POST /api/cart/merge (guestId + JWT)
    API->>DB: Load guest cart + user cart
    API->>DB: Merge line items, recalc total
    API->>DB: Delete guest cart
    DB-->>API: Merged user cart
    API-->>FE: Merge success + user cart
